{"id": "t167-001", "text": "Caught up with Giulia after her knee op. She's been home since Tuesday but can't drive for six weeks, so her husband is doing all the school runs. Remind me to drop some food round Thursday evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee op", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't drive", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop some food round", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t167-002", "text": "Ravi got told on Monday that his whole team is at risk of redundancy. Consultation meeting is the 14th at half 10 and he's dreading it. His wife has just gone back to work part time which helps a bit. Should ring him the evening after the meeting.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "at risk of redundancy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Consultation meeting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th at half 10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "gone back to work part time", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the evening after the meeting", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t167-004", "text": "Zeynep says her manager Ivan is leaving at the end of the month, leaving drinks Thursday at 6. She's been asked to cover his clients until they hire someone and is a bit overwhelmed. Kiara from finance is apparently going for his job too.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "manager", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 6", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "asked to cover his clients", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until they hire someone"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit overwhelmed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "finance", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going for his job", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t167-005", "text": "Oisín's mum had her hip replacement yesterday morning, all went fine. She's in for three or four nights and then he's taking a week off to look after her. Text him Friday to see how she's getting on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oisín", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "three or four nights", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "week off", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t167-007", "text": "Andile has his MRI on Wednesday at 8am, then sees the consultant the week after. He's quite nervous, says the waiting is the worst part. Don't forget to message him that morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andile", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MRI", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday at 8am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "sees the consultant", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite nervous", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t167-008", "text": "Short one. Yosef's dog Biscuit had surgery on his back leg on Monday, home now with a cone. Yosef hasn't slept much.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yosef", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yosef", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "hasn't slept much", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t167-010", "text": "Aditi called. Her grandad's funeral was yesterday, she said it was lovely and loads of people came. She's back at work Monday but going in late. Must check in with her midweek.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back at work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "midweek", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t167-012", "text": "Khadija got the redundancy letter on Friday, two months' notice. She's actually weirdly relieved and wants to retrain as a midwife. Ask her about the course open day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "redundancy letter", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "two months' notice", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "weirdly relieved", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to retrain as a midwife", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask her about the course open day", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "course open day", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t167-014", "text": "Mihai's last chemo session was this morning! Bell ringing and everything. He's got a scan in three months. His wife Teresa said they're going to Cornwall for a week afterwards to celebrate.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mihai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last chemo session", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in three months", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teresa", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Cornwall", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t167-022", "text": "Ivan's last day got moved to Wednesday the 29th. Leaving do afterwards at the Crown, about half 5. Zeynep is collecting for a card and present and I said I'd put a tenner in.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to Wednesday the 29th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Leaving do", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "about half 5", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t167-026", "text": "Chen's been put on a performance improvement plan by his manager. First review is in four weeks. He's gutted and thinks it's because of the Baker fiasco in the summer. Remind me to ask Chen how the first check-in goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chen", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "performance improvement plan", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "First review", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in four weeks", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Baker fiasco", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Chen how the first check-in goes", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chen", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t167-027", "text": "Coffee with Lukas. He's just moved in with his girlfriend Divya in Walthamstow, still surrounded by boxes. Loves bouldering, goes three times a week. Supports Leicester for some reason.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lukas", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Walthamstow", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three times a week"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Leicester", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t167-028", "text": "Eli's dad died on Thursday night, heart attack, totally out of the blue. Eli flies to Tel Aviv tomorrow morning and the funeral is on Sunday. Hannah's staying back with the kids. Must message Eli when he lands, and again a week after. Hannah said he hadn't seen his dad since the summer and feels awful about it. Their eldest keeps asking questions.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies to Tel Aviv", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hannah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message Eli", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "when he lands", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hannah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the summer"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "awful", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t167-029", "text": "Dentist moved to Monday 11th at 4.40. Bring the form.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Dentist", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to Monday 11th at 4.40", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Bring the form", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t167-030", "text": "Teresa says Mihai's scan came back clear!! They're having a little party at theirs on Saturday the 2nd from 7. She said don't bring anything but I'm making a cake anyway.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teresa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mihai", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "little party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday the 2nd from 7", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t167-031", "text": "Divya mentioned in our 1:1 that two people on her team handed in notice this week, Rhys and Tanvi. She's not coping with the workload and is thinking about going part time. Shreya from HR is meeting her Friday at 3pm about it. Honestly she looked wiped out. Her son is starting secondary school next year too, so there's a lot going on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "handed in notice", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tanvi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not coping with the workload", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going part time", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shreya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "HR", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p4"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "meeting her", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 3pm", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wiped out", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "secondary school", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next year", "anchor": "e4"}]}
{"id": "t167-035", "text": "Zeynep found out her pitch to Lopez & Co is Wednesday at 10. She's terrified because Ivan always did them. I'm running through the slides with her Tuesday evening. Message her afterwards to see how it landed.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pitch to Lopez & Co", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday at 10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday evening"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Message her", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t167-036", "text": "Rhys's appendix scare turned out to be kidney stones. He's on painkillers and off the rest of the week. Doesn't want visitors, just memes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "kidney stones", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the rest of the week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Doesn't want visitors, just memes", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t167-037", "text": "Bumped into Yosef and his wife at the station. They've got an IVF appointment on the 21st at half 8 in the morning. Hopeful but nervous. Her sister had twins through the same clinic.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yosef", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "IVF appointment", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 21st at half 8 in the morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Hopeful", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "had twins", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "r2"}]}
{"id": "t167-040", "text": "Andile's results are back, consultant says torn meniscus and he needs keyhole surgery sometime in the new year. Relieved it's nothing worse but annoyed he can't play five a side till spring. Ask him about the surgery date once he hears.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andile", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "torn meniscus", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "keyhole surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the new year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "annoyed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "five a side", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "till spring"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him about the surgery date", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "once he hears", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t167-041", "text": "Long lunch with the old team, good to see everyone. Matilda is now head of ops at a logistics firm and loves it. Marcus got made redundant in August but walked straight into a job at the council, which he starts on the 4th. Neha is on mat leave, baby girl born in September, called Ava. And Lukas is still on the same project, poor guy, still swearing go-live is definitely before Christmas. We said we'd do this every quarter. I need to send Neha something for the baby and congratulate Marcus properly.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "head of ops at a logistics firm", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "loves it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in August", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job at the council", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 4th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Neha", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "on mat leave", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "baby girl", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "born", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lukas", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "on the same project", "owner": "p5", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "go-live", "owner": "p5", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Christmas", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "every quarter"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Neha something for the baby", "owner": "p3", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Neha", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "congratulate Marcus properly", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t167-044", "text": "Eduardo (Edu to everyone) had his leaving lunch today and the clients sent a massive hamper. He flies to Lisbon on the 6th and starts there the Monday after. Wants us all to visit in the spring.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eduardo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Edu", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies to Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 6th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts there", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Monday after", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring"}]}
{"id": "t167-045", "text": "Chen says the Baker account is up for renewal on the 30th and their CFO is threatening to walk. Big call with them Friday at 2, Karim is leading it. Nobody's slept.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "renewal", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 30th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Big call", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 2", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t167-046", "text": "Dalia's operation got cancelled that morning, no beds. She was already gowned up. They've rebooked it for the 12th at 7am. Gutted for her. Call her tomorrow evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th at 7am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Call her", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t167-049", "text": "Ravi update. The consultation happened on the 14th and they offered him either a role in Bristol or the package. He's leaning towards the package and taking a few months off, and his wife is fully on board. Ask Ravi what he decides before the end of the month. Also their daughter Rin got into Edinburgh, so they might all move up there eventually.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "consultation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d0", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few months"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "on board", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Ravi what he decides", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the end of the month", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into Edinburgh", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "eventually"}]}
{"id": "t167-051", "text": "Mia Le, the new client lead, wants the deck by Thursday noon and a call the day after at half 9. The Gupta meeting got pushed to next month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia Le", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "client lead", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Thursday noon"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "call", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after at half 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Gupta meeting", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "to next month", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t167-057", "text": "Kiara's back from Mumbai. The memorial was the day after she landed and the whole family came. Tired but glad she went. She starts a new job at a bank on the 1st. Ask how her first week goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "memorial", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after she landed", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Tired", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "glad", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at a bank", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 1st", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask how her first week goes", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t167-058", "text": "Mihai's dad is back in hospital with a chest infection. Mihai's driving up to Leicester tomorrow morning and staying till Sunday, Divya is covering his clients while he's away. Text him Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mihai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chest infection", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mihai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up to Leicester", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "till Sunday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "while he's away", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
